  "title": "Burke & Herbert Bank & Trust Company Deepens Commitment to Maryland with New Bethesda Branch",
  "summary": "Alexandria, VA – Burke & Herbert Bank & Trust Company (Burke & Herbert), a wholly owned subsidiary of Burke & Herbert Financial Services Corp., today announced the opening of a full-service branch at 7815 Woodmont Avenue in Bethesda, Maryland. The branch joins Burke & Herbert’s commercial lending office which began operating in Bethesda in 2021. Read More »",
